  = must: execute IR6-S01 before creating claim projection contracts, mailbox projection contracts, conflict fixtures, implementation activation plans, dependency changes, executable coordination code, mailbox transport, or generated outputs
  = must: run completed-work review after each IR6 slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts current assumptions
  = must: reject any output that promotes coordination claims, mailbox carriers, rendezvous packets, chat logs, IRC logs, Matrix events, web events, terminal output, Codex state, Langflow diagrams, generated traces, or generated reports to source authority

